{"nodes": [{"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "label": "Despliegue PythonAnywhere + Vercel (dos or\u00edgenes)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alternativa al runbook del VPS. API en PythonAnywhere y SPA en Vercel implica dos or\u00edgenes distintos: no hay forma de evitar CORS cuando front y back viven en dominios distintos, y VITE_API_URL apunta al backend en vez de quedar vac\u00edo. El bot de WhatsApp queda apagado porque el refactor para este entorno no est\u00e1 terminado."}, {"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_cors_allowed_origins", "label": "CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS para el dominio de Vercel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sin el dominio de Vercel en CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS el navegador bloquea las llamadas del SPA a la API y ni siquiera se puede loguear. Debe coincidir exacto: con https:// y sin barra final. Hay que agregar tambi\u00e9n *.vercel.app si se usan preview deployments. CSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS, en cambio, s\u00f3lo hace falta para el login de /admin/, que se abre directo en PA."}, {"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_pyafipws_import_perezoso", "label": "Import perezoso de pyafipws en fiscal/afip.py", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "En PythonAnywhere no hay sudo para instalar los -dev que pyafipws necesita para compilar. Hoy el import en fiscal/afip.py es top-level, as\u00ed que sin el paquete instalado toda la app deja de arrancar por culpa de un m\u00f3dulo que ni se usa todav\u00eda (Fase 7 en pausa). El arreglo propuesto es hacer el import perezoso: cambio de 2 l\u00edneas. Por eso el runbook manda probar la instalaci\u00f3n antes de avanzar con el resto."}, {"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_wsgi_config", "label": "Configuraci\u00f3n WSGI de la Web app en PythonAnywhere", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Manual configuration: el archivo WSGI inserta /home/<user>/app/backend en sys.path, fija DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=config.settings y expone get_wsgi_application(). Se mapea /static/ a backend/staticfiles (s\u00f3lo hace falta para el admin de Django, el frontend lo sirve Vercel) y se activa Force HTTPS. PythonAnywhere reemplaza a gunicorn+nginx del runbook del VPS."}, {"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_vercel_spa_routing", "label": "Ruteo SPA de React Router en Vercel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vercel resuelve solo el fallback a index.html para proyectos Vite/SPA, as\u00ed que recargar /pos o /clientes no da 404 sin configurar nada extra. Root Directory = frontend y el preset Vite se detecta autom\u00e1ticamente."}, {"id": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_checklist_verificacion", "label": "Checklist de verificaci\u00f3n post-deploy (PA + Vercel)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mismos conteos del seed que el runbook del VPS y los mismos 242 tests, m\u00e1s dos chequeos propios de la topolog\u00eda de dos or\u00edgenes: errores de CORS en la consola del navegador y F5 en /clientes o /pos sin 404."}], "edges": [{"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_despliegue_vps_single_host", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_cors_allowed_origins", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_pyafipws_import_perezoso", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_pyafipws_import_perezoso", "target": "backend_requirements_pyafipws_git_pin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_wsgi_config", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_vercel_spa_routing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_checklist_verificacion", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/README_PYTHONANYWHERE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_readme_pythonanywhere_despliegue_pa_vercel", "target": "deploy_re